      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4354858398438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "the data by the principal investigator and colleagues at the University of Cape Town and the South",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4321899414062,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "African Medical Research Council is gratefully acknowledged. However, during the GDG meeting the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3958740234375,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "panel decided that the data from this study could not be used to complement discussion on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4078979492188,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "population, intervention, comparator and outcome (PICO) question designed for that study, owing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4234008789062,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "to early termination of the trial and variability of the components in the intervention regimen. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.43115234375,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "does not undermine the high value of the trial results, which reiterate the inferiority and significantly",
