      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.435546875,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "worse safety profile of the DR-TB regimens based on injectable medicines and fluoroquinolones (but",
