      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.4198608398438,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "not including new and repurposed drugs). Importantly, the trial showed that better outcomes could",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        524.3676147460938,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "be achieved with a 6-month all-oral regimen than with the traditional 9-month or longer injectable-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        472.51025390625,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "based regimens, supporting the concept of a 6-month all-oral regimen for MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.2946319580078,
        527.4700927734375,
        248.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "Two randomized controlled trials (RCTs) that concluded in 2021 (TB-PRACTECAL and ZeNix) provided",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979631423950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.49464416503906,
        527.1547241210938,
        261.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "new evidence and prompted assessment by WHO to develop new or updated recommendations for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996048927307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.694580078125,
        527.4055786132812,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "wide programmatic use of the BPaLM/BPaL regimen for treatment of MDR/RR-TB and pre-XDR-TB,",
