      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.4244384765625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "and two variations of the 9-month regimen for those without fluoroquinolone resistance. The latest",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        524.4050903320312,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "evidence-based guidelines for the treatment of drug-resistant TB, including MDR/RR-TB and pre-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        527.5181274414062,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "XDR-TB, were published by WHO in December 2022 – “WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965546607971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        353.5023193359375,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "Module 4: treatment – drug-resistant tuberculosis treatment”.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.5648193359375,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "In 2024, two clinical trials, BEAT-TB and endTB, shared new evidence on the use of the novel 6-month",
