        421.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "This chapter provides specific recommendations on the treatment of DR-TB, including the use of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.27581787109375,
        527.4003295898438,
        434.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "regimens for rifampicin-susceptible, isoniazid-resistant TB (Hr-TB), shorter and longer regimens for",
